cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or software, please cite it using the
  metadata in this file.
type: dataset
title: 'Mapping the Shrines of Pakistan'
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English/Urdu), schema-validated, open dataset of 169 sacred
  sites across Pakistan. Covers Muslim Sufi shrines (dargahs, mazars), Hindu
  temples (mandirs), Sikh gurdwaras, Nanakpanthi/Udasi darbars, Jain temples
  and secular memorials, with structured provenance tracking,
  a Frictionless Data Package descriptor, and a companion interactive web map.
  Built for Harvard computational humanities research.
